{"id":"74ea454cf6a2a409","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor.md","title":"Factoring from a Nontrivial Square Root of One","display":"lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor — Factoring from a Nontrivial Square Root of One","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor","aliases":["28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor"],"display":"lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor — Factoring from a Nontrivial Square Root of One","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 10.22 and its proof","source_printed_pages":"228","source_pdf_pages":"254","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor — Factoring from a Nontrivial Square Root of One"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 10.22 and its proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"228"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"254"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(Y\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^2\\equiv1\\pmod N\">\\(Y^2\\equiv1\\pmod N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\not\\equiv1,-1\\pmod N\">\\(Y\\not\\equiv1,-1\\pmod N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1&lt;\\gcd(Y-1,N)&lt;N,\\qquad1&lt;\\gcd(Y+1,N)&lt;N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1&lt;\\gcd(Y-1,N)&lt;N,\\qquad1&lt;\\gcd(Y+1,N)&lt;N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>N整除(Y−1)(Y+1)。若gcd(Y−1,N)=1，则Y−1模N可逆，迫使Y+1≡0，与假设矛盾；若gcd=N则Y≡1，亦矛盾。交换两因子给第二式。精确适用于Shor算法中偶数阶产生的非平凡平方根，不需要N是半素数。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 10.22 and its proof；印刷页 228；PDF 页 254。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Factoring from a Nontrivial Square Root of One，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"Y^2\\equiv1\\pmod N","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\not\\equiv1,-1\\pmod N","display":false},{"tex":"1<\\gcd(Y-1,N)<N,\\qquad1<\\gcd(Y+1,N)<N.","display":true}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}